msgstr "Timezone จะถูกตั้งค่าโดยอัตโนมัติเมื่ออุปกรณ์เข้าสู่ระบบ"

#. Definition of "HTTP": This is a well-known industry term. There might be a well-known translation, or, it might be common to use the English term. https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hypertext_Transfer_Protocol
msgid "The URL provided uses the insecure HTTP protocol. It is possible that attackers on the network may be able to intercept any messages. Are you sure you want to continue?"
msgstr ""

