msgid "This disk is managed by a higher-level volume manager (dynamic / LDM, Storage Spaces, or similar) and isn't safe for this tool to modify. Manage it from the source Windows install (diskmgmt.msc or PowerShell Storage-* cmdlets) before running a restore."
msgstr ""

